# RaidBossForTeleportDungeon (25333, Anakazel), placed by an npcmaker whose territory holds
# it, level 1 like the level 1 character. A hit of 22 inside its territory runs its parents:
# RaidBossStandard wants the character at 22 / (1 + 7) * 20000. Jumped out of its territory,
# the next hit goes unanswered: its desire stays. Its maker script events (2 as it appears
# and on its 3 minute check, 3 on a check with no hit for 180 s and as it dies) are in
# tests/ai/raid_boss5_test.go: the format renders no maker event.
character Hunter 1
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossStandard
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossAlone.RaidBossType1.RaidBossForTeleportDungeon
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossAlone.RaidBossType1.RaidBossType1
territory rift -200 -200 400 200 -100 100
npc boss 25333 RaidBoss 100 0 0 maker rift

hit boss 22
  desires boss attack(player)=55000
jump boss 2000 0 0
hit boss 22
  desires boss attack(player)=55000
